message.content:
Ecco una pagina HTML completa per la startup AI NeuraForge in stile cyberpunk neon, con tutti gli elementi richiesti e commenti dettagliati.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
    <!-- Meta tag per codifica e viewport -->
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NeuraForge · AI Startup Cyberpunk</title>

    <!-- CSS interno: stile cyberpunk neon -->
    <style>
        /* RESET e base */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Roboto', system-ui, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: #0a0c0f; /* sfondo scuro cyberpunk */
            color: #e0e0e0;
            line-height: 1.6;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        /* tipografia cyberpunk */
        h1, h2, h3, h4 {
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 3.2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00f0ff, #ff00c8);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: #00f0ff;
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px #00f0ff66;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #ff00c8;
            padding-bottom: 0.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        /* link e interazioni */
        a {
            color: #ff00c8;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        a:hover {
            color: #00f0ff;
            text-shadow: 0 0 6px #00f0ff;
        }

        /* layout container */
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        /* ===== HEADER ===== */
        header {
            background: #12151a;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #ff00c8;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(255, 0, 200, 0.3);
            padding: 1rem 0;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        header .container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00f0ff, #ff00c8);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            text-shadow: 0 0 12px #00f0ffaa;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        nav a {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            padding: 0.5rem 0.2rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        nav a:hover {
            border-bottom-color: #ff00c8;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* ===== HERO ===== */
        .hero {
            padding: 4rem 0;
            text-align: center;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, #1f1a2e, #0a0c0f 80%);
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #ff00c866;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
            color: #b0b8c0;
            text-shadow: 0 0 4px #000;
        }

        .hero .cta-button {
            background: transparent;
            border: 2px solid #ff00c8;
            color: #ff00c8;
            padding: 0.9rem 2.5rem;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-radius: 0;
            transition: 0.3s;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px #ff00c866;
        }
        .hero .cta-button:hover {
            background: #ff00c8;
            color: #0a0c0f;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px #ff00c8;
            border-color: #ff00c8;
        }

        /* ===== FEATURE CARDS ===== */
        .features {
            padding: 3rem 0;
        }

        .feature-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: #1a1d24;
            border: 1px solid #2f3540;
            padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
            transition: 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.1);
            position: relative;
        }
        .feature-card:hover {
            border-color: #00f0ff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px #00f0ff4d;
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            color: #ff00c8;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }

        .feature-card p {
            color: #bcc0c8;
        }

        /* ===== TABELLA PREZZI (3 TIER) ===== */
        .pricing {
            padding: 3rem 0;
            background: #0e1116;
        }

        .pricing-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .pricing-tier {
            background: #1a1d24;
            border: 1px solid #2f3540;
            padding: 2rem 1.2rem;
            text-align: center;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .pricing-tier:hover {
            border-color: #ff00c8;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px #ff00c866;
        }

        .pricing-tier h3 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: #00f0ff;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .pricing-tier .price {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00f0ff, #ff00c8);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
        }

        .pricing-tier ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }
        .pricing-tier ul li {
            padding: 0.4rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #2f3540;
        }

        .pricing-tier .btn-tier {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid #00f0ff;
            color: #00f0ff;
            padding: 0.6rem 2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.3s;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .pricing-tier .btn-tier:hover {
            background: #00f0ff;
            color: #0a0c0f;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px #00f0ff;
        }

        /* ===== FORM CONTATTI ===== */
        .contact {
            padding: 3rem 0;
        }

        .contact form {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #1a1d24;
            padding: 2rem;
            border: 1px solid #2f3540;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 0, 200, 0.2);
        }

        .contact label {
            display: block;
            margin: 1rem 0 0.3rem;
            color: #00f0ff;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .contact input, .contact textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.8rem;
            background: #0e1116;
            border: 1px solid #2f3540;
            color: #e0e0e0;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .contact input:focus, .contact textarea:focus {
            border-color: #ff00c8;
            outline: none;
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px #ff00c8;
        }

        .contact textarea {
            min-height: 120px;
            resize: vertical;
        }

        .contact .error-message {
            color: #ff4d6d;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 0.2rem;
            min-height: 1.2rem;
        }

